OL,3,GNEWSAKnife-wielding man hit by police
OL,4,Acar admits assaulting officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was struck twice by a police
OL,7,Fcar after chasing officers with a knife
OL,8,Fand injuring a police dog has admitted
OL,9,Fassault.
OL,11,FOfficers ran over Linus Luopas, struck
OL,12,Fhim with batons and used incapacitant
OL,13,Fspray on the 29-year-old after he
OL,14,Fwielded the blade at another innocent
OL,15,Fman near his home in Aberdeen.
OL,17,FLuopas was also bitten by police dog
OL,18,FZeus during efforts to subdue him on 28
OL,19,FFebruary last year.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
